<title>UK: OFFER invites comment on planned Energy buy.</title>
<headline>OFFER invites comment on planned Energy buy.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>UK electricity watchdog OFFER said on Monday it was inviting comments from interested parties regarding the proposed acquisiton of Energy Group Plc by PacifiCorp.</p>
<p>In order to meet the timetable for advising the UK Secretary of State on the matter, comments were invited by June 23, 1997, it said in a statement.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 4019</p>
</text>
